ok:Mushroom|mushrooms]]\n* 1 envelope vegetable soup mix\n* 6 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] (220 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:Crab|crab]] meat \n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (120 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Sour Cream|sour cream]] or plain [[Cookbook:Yogurt|yogurt]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] plain dry [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]\n* 1 tbsp fresh [[Cookbook:Dill|dill]] (optional)\n* 2 dashes [[Cookbook:Hot Sauce|hot pepper sauce]]\n* ⅛ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]] (or to taste) \n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]], melted\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 350°F (180°C).\n# Remove and finely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chop]] mushroom stems. \n# In a bowl, combine chopped mushroom stems, vegetable soup mix, crabmeat, sour cream, bread crumbs, dill, hot pepper sauce, and pepper. Set aside.  \n# On lightly greased [[Cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]], arrange mushroom caps; stuff with crabmeat mixture, then [[Cookbook:Brush|brush]] with butter. \n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] 15 minutes or until tender. \n\n[[Category:Recipes using mushroom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using crab]]\n[[Category:Recipes for stuffing and dressing]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dill]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hot sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Pescatarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Halal recipes]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Stuffed Mushrooms with Crabmeat","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"12 ea. large mushrooms","sourceText":"12 ea. large mushrooms","amountText":"12 ea. large mushrooms","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 envelope vegetable soup mix","sourceText":"1 envelope vegetable soup mix","amountText